From 3521267d122fcc1166b21d410c853b64844f1dd3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: shota <monyuonyu@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 08:33:29 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 047/107] PartDesign: size a new linear pattern after what it
 repeats; clearer pattern texts

A new linear pattern used a fixed length of 100 mm, which put the copy of
a small part far outside the view. It now starts at twice the size of the
repeated feature, rounded up to 1, 2 or 5 times a power of ten. In
Japanese, "Direction 2" was translated as "Section 2"; this and the
other texts of the pattern panels are corrected or made plainer.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
